le=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">Can I try it on?</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Je peux l'essayer ?","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275970,"_nanoseconds":89000000}},{"id":"RcsnfU0XUQOzlTv1ucAR","level":"a1","lesson":9,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a1-l09-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>C'est trop petit.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">It's too small.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"C'est trop petit.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275970,"_nanoseconds":128000000}},{"id":"KJbLkoJ90Kq0GiKKXFCW","level":"a1","lesson":9,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a1-l09-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Bonjour ! Je peux vous aider ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello! Can I help you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Oui, je cherche une robe rouge.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, I'm looking for a red dress.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Quelle taille faites-vous ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What size are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je fais du quarante.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm a size forty.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Voilà. La cabine d'essayage est là-bas.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Here you go. The fitting room is over there.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je peux l'essayer ? Elle est un peu grande.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Can I try it on? It's a bit big.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Voici une taille en dessous.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Here is one size down.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Parfait ! Elle me va bien. Je la prends.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Perfect! It suits me. I'll take it.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275970,"_nanoseconds":174000000}},{"id":"zw3gngrObAEoCs4ysrp2","level":"a1","lesson":9,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a1-l09-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Bonjour ! Je peux vous aider ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello! Can I help you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Oui, je cherche une robe rouge.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, I'm looking for a red dress.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Oui, je cherche une robe rouge.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275970,"_nanoseconds":568000000}},{"id":"kXeOjZ5wskvt1qEBfMMK","level":"a1","lesson":9,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a1-l09-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Quelle taille faites-vous ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What size are you?</span></p><p style=\"m